    "created_at": "2018-06-26T23:25:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-26T23:25:52Z",
    "body": "If element name is valid custom element name, then is value shouldn't be preserved, since is value is for builtins only.\r\nI guess if createElement(\"button\", {  is : \"input\"}); is used, storing is value doesn't make too much sense either. So, basically store is value only if it can be useful later?",
