    "created_at": "2018-06-28T21:01:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-06-28T21:01:50Z",
    "body": "OK, so I'm writing a patch to null out _is_ (before setting it) in the \"Otherwise\" clause (step 7), if either _localName_ is a valid custom element name, or _is_ is not a valid custom element name. I'll post it for review shortly; hopefully that's what you had in mind.\r\n\r\nIt kind of feels like we should throw in this case, but meh, probably not worth it...",
